{C:819582860100010036000000}
{C:81930000}{C:81958296B33A00000000}As far as the eye can see,
the endless white Cloud Sea.




{x00}

{C:819582860100010037000000}
{C:81930000}{C:81958296B43A00000000}But the Cloud Sea, the Cloud Stream,
had the power to break matter down.

{x00}

{C:81958296B53A00000000}And so, though people dreamed of the outside world,
they remained bound to their continents.




{x00}

{C:819582860100010038000000}
{C:81930000}{C:81958296B63A00000000}Among them, only the continent of Claudia
continued its tireless efforts.






{x00}

{C:819582860100010039000000}
{C:81930000}{C:81958296B73A00000000}It commissioned the Cloud Ship Astante
and ventured onto the Cloud Sea.

{x00}

{C:81958296B83A00000000}However, the excessive haste caused problems,
and the Astante returned to port.





{x00}

{C:81958286010001003A000000}
{C:81930000}{C:81958296B93A00000000}Claudia tried instead to commission
another ship of the same type, the Norstan.

{x00}

{C:81958286010001003B000000}
{C:81930000}{C:81958296BB3A00000000}From somewhere unknown,
an armed group including a black FT attacked.

{x00}

{C:81930000}{C:81958296BD3A00000000}The Astante was hastily repaired,
and the pursuit of the Norstan was about to begin.


{x00}
